      "sourceUrl": "https://tropica.com/en/plants/plantdetails/Crinumthaianum(093XL)/4538",
      "html": "<p>Crinum thaianum is undemanding apart from the fact that it needs plenty of space. Keep the top 2/3 of the bulb visible when you plant it because otherwise the bulb tends to rot.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "notes",
      "source": "tropica",
      "sourceUrl": "https://tropica.com/en/plants/plantdetails/Crinumthaianum(093XL)/4538",
      "html": "<p>Crinum thaianum from Thailand is a distinctive bulbous plant belonging to the lily family having 60-200 cm long leaves. When the plant grows older it sometimes sends a flower stem up to the water surface with an aromatic, elegant lily flower.</p>"
    }
